{"step_index":323,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T02:35:02Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-28T11:35:02+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-28T11:35:06+09:00\nThe search for \"\"605-81-70391\" OR \"비엔아이\" \"부산\" \"605-81\" OR \"606-81\" OR \"607-81\" OR \"606-86\" OR \"607-86\" site:bizno.net\" returned the following summary:\n검색하신 사업자등록번호 **605-81-70391**은 **(주)에듀인잡컨설팅**의 사업자번호입니다.\n\n해당 기업에 대한 주요 정보는 다음과 같습니다.\n\n*   **기업명:** (주)에듀인잡컨설팅\n*   **주요 사업:** 취업지원서비스, 채용대행, 교육 컨설팅, 정부·지자체 사업지원 등\n*   **소재지:** 부산광역시 남구 용소로 8번길 48, 금양타임월드 2~3층 (또는 수영로 276 연정빌딩 2~4층으로 확인되는 기록도 있음)\n*   **기타 브랜드:** '클릭마이비즈', 'ECAS(취업준비도 진단 플랫폼)' 등의 서비스를 운영하고 있습니다.\n\n문의하신 \"비엔아이\"의 경우, 부산 소재의 동명 기업((주)비엔아이, (주)비엔아이물류 등)들이 검색되나, 제공해주신 사업자번호 **605-81-70391**과는 일치하지 않는 것으로 확인됩니다."}
{"step_index":324,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T02:35:06Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Scrape all bizno search results for BNI / 비엔아이 and filter for Busan entities.\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import urllib.request\\nimport urllib.parse\\nimport json\\nimport re\\n\\nheaders = {\\n    'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\\n}\\n\\ndef validate_biz_no(val):\\n    clean = re.sub(r'[^0-9]', '', str(val))\\n    if len(clean) != 10:\\n        return False, clean\\n    weights = [1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 5]\\n    digits = [int(c) for c in clean]\\n    s = sum(digits[i] * weights[i] for i in range(8))\\n    s += (digits[8] * 5) // 10 + (digits[8] * 5) % 10\\n    chk = (10 - (s % 10)) % 10\\n    return digits[9] == chk, clean\\n\\nquery = \\\"비엔아이\\\"\\nurl = f\\\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(query)}\\\"\\n\\nreq = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=5) as resp:\\n    html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n\\narticles = re.findall(r'/article/(\\\\d{10})', html)\\nprint(f\\\"Total articles found for {query}: {len(articles)}\\\")\\n\\nbusan_matches = []\\nfor a in set(articles):\\n    det_url = f\\\"https://bizno.net/article/{a}\\\"\\n    dreq = urllib.request.Request(det_url, headers=headers)\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(dreq, timeout=3) as dresp:\\n            dhtml = dresp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n            name_m = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', dhtml)\\n            title = name_m.group(1) if name_m else ''\\n            if '부산' in dhtml:\\n                is_val, _ = validate_biz_no(a)\\n                # extract ceo, addr\\n                busan_matches.append({\\n                    'biz_no': f\\\"{a[:3]}-{a[3:5]}-{a[5:]}\\\",\\n                    'title': title,\\n                    'valid': is_val,\\n                    'is_busan': True\\n                })\\n                print(f\\\"Found Busan BNI: {a} -> {title}\\\")\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        pass\\n\\nwith open(r'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\\\scratch\\\\bni_busan_matches.json', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    json.dump(busan_matches, \n<truncated 35 bytes>","Description":"\"Scrape Busan BNI companies\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\\\scratch\\\\find_busan_bni.py\"","toolAction":"\"Finding Busan BNI\"","toolSummary":"\"Run find_busan_bni.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
